name andika
category Package
revision 62157
shortdesc andika fonts with support for all LaTeX engines
longdesc This package provides LaTeX, pdfLaTeX, XeLaTeX and LuaLaTeX
longdesc support for the Andika family of fonts designed by SIL
longdesc International especially for literacy use, taking into account
longdesc the needs of beginning readers. The focus is on clear,
longdesc easy-to-perceive letterforms that will not be readily confused
longdesc with one another.
